{"4951840":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Infi-Knight","steam_appid":4951840,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5024510],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy, desktop-companion incremental idle game about a Knight cursed with immortality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Knight clashes against endless waves of undead, but for what? The memories, the reasons, The Order they swore themselves to, all faded to dust long ago. Now they simply fight, die, and rise. Again, and again, and again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the fleeting flames of Remembrance have begun to spark. Unravel the mystery of the Knight's immortality curse, piece together a tattered past, and perhaps grant them the chance to break the Cycle of Undeath once and for all.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A endless battle against the undead in the corner of your screen<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infi-Knight lives in a resizable, movable window beside your other tasks. Look over to tithe your Gold, swap a Weapon, ignite a surge of <i>Zeal<\/i>, or unlock what the Knight has remembered in the <strong>Memory<\/strong> codex. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death rejects you<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Knight has one hit point and has been curse-bound to never truly die. Sooner or later, the horde<strong> <i>will<\/i><\/strong> reach them. The Knight will fall, and rise, and fight again. <i>However<\/i>, <strong><i>nothing is lost<\/i><\/strong> when the Knight dies: every coin and every XP orb gained from the undead contributes to the Knight's growing power. <i>Immortality<\/i> is your punishment and <i>penance<\/i>.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A worthy arsenal<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Weapons<\/strong>, each with their own way of unmaking the undead. A lane-clearing Halberd, a Holy Mace blessed by God, a full-field Arbalest, a burning Lance that sweeps across the horde, a massive Greatsword to cleave the graves, and more. Every kill contributes to that weapon's <strong><i>Mastery<\/i><\/strong>, a system that rewards sticking with a specific weapon to unlock passive upgrades with powerful <i>Tier 5<\/i> and <i>10<\/i> <strong><i>Capstone Perks<\/i><\/strong> that <i>change the way each weapon plays<\/i>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steadily grow your power<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As The Knight stands against the undead, they collect <i>XP orbs<\/i> and gain up to <strong>99<\/strong> <strong>Levels<\/strong><i> <\/i>to fuel their baseline power and unlock <strong>new gameplay<\/strong> features. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swear your Oath and gather lost Relics<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swear one of six <i><strong>Oaths<\/strong><\/i>, each a bargain to be weighed. Equip <strong><i>Relics<\/i><\/strong> that pair with your Weapon and Oath to create your very own build with which to stand against the endless undead. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rekindle Memories to uncover your past<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach milestones to reawaken your history as a Knight of <i>The Order.<\/i> With rekindled memories come new <strong>Weapons<\/strong>, <strong>Relics<\/strong>, <strong>Lore <\/strong>and more.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Embers from Bosses<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pry valuable <strong>Embers<\/strong> from the bones of <strong>Bosses<\/strong>. Then, spend them by performing <i><strong>Last Rites<\/strong><\/i> to gain permanent upgrades back at your <strong>Camp<\/strong>. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore your Camp<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard-won <strong>Embers<\/strong> are consumed at <strong>Camp,<\/strong> which<strong> <\/strong>provides you with <strong><i>permanent meta-progression<\/i><\/strong> that unlocks <strong><i>new gameplay<\/i><\/strong> elements and steadily improves your power. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A long incremental game with a Story Mode ending, and an unlockable Endless Mode.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>Memories<\/strong> across four acts, rekindled by your milestones and accomplishments. Piece together who the Knight was, the nature of their Immortality Curse, what their Order did, and why the dead will not remain buried. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true desktop companion incremental idler. Resizable, borderless, option for always-on-top. Built to live beside your other tasks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Weapons<\/strong> with per-weapon <strong>Mastery<\/strong> ranks and <i>transformative<\/i> <strong>Capstone perks<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Relics<\/strong> to collect with build-changing passives<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6<\/strong> <strong>Oaths<\/strong> to swear, each with an upside and downside to weigh<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Camp<\/strong> permanent meta-progression upgrade system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250 Levels<\/strong> to attain<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of<\/strong> <strong>Memories<\/strong> telling a four-act dark fantasy story in fragments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of hours<\/strong> of gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable<strong> Infinite Mode<\/strong> <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global <strong>Leaderboard<\/strong> to rank each faithful Knight<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ending that may just solve the Immortality Curse<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule illustration credit - <strong>Rodrigo Balmaceda<\/strong><br><br><br><br><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy, desktop-companion incremental idle game about a Knight cursed with immortality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Knight clashes against endless waves of undead, but for what? The memories, the reasons, The Order they swore themselves to, all faded to dust long ago. Now they simply fight, die, and rise. Again, and again, and again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the fleeting flames of Remembrance have begun to spark. Unravel the mystery of the Knight's immortality curse, piece together a tattered past, and perhaps grant them the chance to break the Cycle of Undeath once and for all.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A endless battle against the undead in the corner of your screen<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infi-Knight lives in a resizable, movable window beside your other tasks. Look over to tithe your Gold, swap a Weapon, ignite a surge of <i>Zeal<\/i>, or unlock what the Knight has remembered in the <strong>Memory<\/strong> codex. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/5fae53534567b025b305a3b7b8e6bc98.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death rejects you<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Knight has one hit point and has been curse-bound to never truly die. Sooner or later, the horde<strong> <i>will<\/i><\/strong> reach them. The Knight will fall, and rise, and fight again. <i>However<\/i>, <strong><i>nothing is lost<\/i><\/strong> when the Knight dies: every coin and every XP orb gained from the undead contributes to the Knight's growing power. <i>Immortality<\/i> is your punishment and <i>penance<\/i>.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c9f3fadab2c1093bd5588d8d06787099.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A worthy arsenal<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Weapons<\/strong>, each with their own way of unmaking the undead. A lane-clearing Halberd, a Holy Mace blessed by God, a full-field Arbalest, a burning Lance that sweeps across the horde, a massive Greatsword to cleave the graves, and more. Every kill contributes to that weapon's <strong><i>Mastery<\/i><\/strong>, a system that rewards sticking with a specific weapon to unlock passive upgrades with powerful <i>Tier 5<\/i> and <i>10<\/i> <strong><i>Capstone Perks<\/i><\/strong> that <i>change the way each weapon plays<\/i>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/aae27dd3b30529597c4c4477b513fd4a.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steadily grow your power<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As The Knight stands against the undead, they collect <i>XP orbs<\/i> and gain up to <strong>99<\/strong> <strong>Levels<\/strong><i> <\/i>to fuel their baseline power and unlock <strong>new gameplay<\/strong> features. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/e08d2260adc137beaac63384a0048019.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swear your Oath and gather lost Relics<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swear one of six <i><strong>Oaths<\/strong><\/i>, each a bargain to be weighed. Equip <strong><i>Relics<\/i><\/strong> that pair with your Weapon and Oath to create your very own build with which to stand against the endless undead. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/efb81483fd4ccc40c3c90870bd4a5f2c.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rekindle Memories to uncover your past<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach milestones to reawaken your history as a Knight of <i>The Order.<\/i> With rekindled memories come new <strong>Weapons<\/strong>, <strong>Relics<\/strong>, <strong>Lore <\/strong>and more.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/c02df635a2cfbd8eb18b8aa654935d62.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Embers from Bosses<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pry valuable <strong>Embers<\/strong> from the bones of <strong>Bosses<\/strong>. Then, spend them by performing <i><strong>Last Rites<\/strong><\/i> to gain permanent upgrades back at your <strong>Camp<\/strong>. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/a32a63fe1e7bf1bf704b48da86cf1aac.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore your Camp<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard-won <strong>Embers<\/strong> are consumed at <strong>Camp,<\/strong> which<strong> <\/strong>provides you with <strong><i>permanent meta-progression<\/i><\/strong> that unlocks <strong><i>new gameplay<\/i><\/strong> elements and steadily improves your power. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.poster.avif?t=1793731840\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.webm?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/extras\/b1d21b1f6e2906f990efd69cdd63edbd.mp4?t=1793731840\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A long incremental game with a Story Mode ending, and an unlockable Endless Mode.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>Memories<\/strong> across four acts, rekindled by your milestones and accomplishments. Piece together who the Knight was, the nature of their Immortality Curse, what their Order did, and why the dead will not remain buried. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true desktop companion incremental idler. Resizable, borderless, option for always-on-top. Built to live beside your other tasks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Weapons<\/strong> with per-weapon <strong>Mastery<\/strong> ranks and <i>transformative<\/i> <strong>Capstone perks<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Relics<\/strong> to collect with build-changing passives<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6<\/strong> <strong>Oaths<\/strong> to swear, each with an upside and downside to weigh<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Camp<\/strong> permanent meta-progression upgrade system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250 Levels<\/strong> to attain<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of<\/strong> <strong>Memories<\/strong> telling a four-act dark fantasy story in fragments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of hours<\/strong> of gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable<strong> Infinite Mode<\/strong> <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global <strong>Leaderboard<\/strong> to rank each faithful Knight<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ending that may just solve the Immortality Curse<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule illustration credit - <strong>Rodrigo Balmaceda<\/strong><br><br><br><br><\/p>","short_description":"A dark fantasy desktop-companion incremental that idles while you work, play, or browse. Play as a Knight cursed with immortality locked in endless battle against the undead. Grow stronger with every death, uncover the curses' secrets and the Knight's dark past, then break the cycle of undeath.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/12ab3c62296a6ddbecf7b9e87460165aa225b71b\/header.jpg?t=1793731840","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/91b1bc29cea57e82ebfb8b2234097bcfedf7da95\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793731840","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/91b1bc29cea57e82ebfb8b2234097bcfedf7da95\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793731840","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core, 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any GPU with OpenGL 3.3 drivers<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> SteamOS 3.0+ \/ Ubunto 22.04+ or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86_64 dual-core, 2.0 Ghz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible (Intel HD 4000+ \/ AMD Radeon HD 7000+ \/ NVIDIA GeForce 600+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["Vozmog"],"publishers":["Signal Filter"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":699,"final":594,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"$6.99","final_formatted":"$5.94"},"packages":[1718562],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Infi-Knight","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1718562,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Infi-Knight - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$6.99<\/span> $5.94","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":594}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":true},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/3dee61f70259cb8be3f017432726886a2a4c948d\/ss_3dee61f70259cb8be3f017432726886a2a4c948d.600x338.jpg?t=1793731840","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4951840\/3dee61f70259cb8be3f017432726886a2a4c948d\/ss_3dee61f70259c